<tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:chol/shacharit/conclusion/al_tira">
<tei:p><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:proverbs/3/25" xml:id="ref_al_tira"/>Be not afraid of sudden terror, nor of the storm that strikes the wicked. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:isaiah/8/10" xml:id="ref_utzu"/>Form your plot—it shall fail; lay your plan—it shall not prevail! For God is with us. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:isaiah/46/4" xml:id="ref_vead"/>Even to your old age I will be the same; when you are gray-headed, still I will sustain you; I have made you, and I will bear you; I will sustain you and save you. <tei:milestone unit="verse"/></tei:p>
</tei:div>
